    "source": {
      "inline": "on bar(pos, dur)\n\tset n to 10\n\tif dur is 0 then return \"\"\n\tset f to round (pos / dur * n)\n\tif f > n then set f to n\n\tset s to \"\"\n\trepeat with i from 1 to n\n\t\tif i is f then\n\t\t\tset s to s & \"●\"\n\t\telse if i < f then\n\t\t\tset s to s & \"━\"\n\t\telse\n\t\t\tset s to s & \"─\"\n\t\tend if\n\tend repeat\n\treturn s\nend bar\non probe(appName)\n\tif application appName is not running then return \"\"\n\tusing terms from application \"Google Chrome\"\n\t\ttell application appName\n\t\t\trepeat with w in windows\n\t\t\t\trepeat with t in tabs of w\n\t\t\t\t\tif URL of t contains \"youtube.com\" then\n\t\t\t\t\t\tset r to execute t javascript \"(function(){var v=document.querySelector('video');if(!v||v.paused)return '';var m=navigator.mediaSession&&navigator.mediaSession.metadata;var t=m&&m.title?m.title:document.title;var a=m&&m.artist?' – '+m.artist:'';return t+a+'|'+v.currentTime+'|'+v.duration})()\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif r is not \"\" and r is not missing value then return r\n\t\t\t\t\tend if\n\t\t\t\tend repeat\n\t\t\tend repeat\n\t\tend tell\n\tend using terms from\n\treturn \"\"\nend probe\nset r to my probe(\"Brave Browser\")\nif r is \"\" then set r to my probe(\"Google Chrome\")\nif r is \"\" then return \"\"\nset AppleScript's text item delimiters to \"|\"\nset parts to text items of r\nset ttl to item 1 of parts\nif (count of ttl) > 18 then set ttl to (text 1 thru 17 of ttl) & \"…\"\nset cur to (item 2 of parts) as real\nset dur to (item 3 of parts) as real\nreturn ttl & \"  \" & my bar(cur, dur)"
    },
    "action": "shellScript",
    "autoResize": false,
    "executablePath": "__MTMR_DIR__/seekbar",
    "shellArguments": [],
    "longAction": "appleScript",
    "longActionAppleScript": {
      "inline": "repeat with appName in {\"Brave Browser\", \"Google Chrome\"}\n\tif application appName is running then\n\t\tusing terms from application \"Google Chrome\"\n\t\t\ttell application appName\n\t\t\t\trepeat with w in windows\n\t\t\t\t\trepeat with t in tabs of w\n\t\t\t\t\t\tif URL of t contains \"youtube.com\" then\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\texecute t javascript \"(function(){var v=document.querySelector('video');if(v){v.paused?v.play():v.pause()}})()\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\treturn\n\t\t\t\t\t\tend if\n\t\t\t\t\tend repeat\n\t\t\t\tend repeat\n\t\t\tend tell\n\t\tend using terms from\n\tend if\nend repeat"
    },
